//RS //! Read-only slice of the Jetpack hangar store (D-JPK12; U2) — root
//RS //! resolution and listing of already-recorded entries only.
//RS //!
//RS //! Card #367 / D-PRODUCT-SPLIT1=C: this is the "store" data half of the
//RS //! model/engine split. Realization, cache verification/leasing, GC, and
//RS //! quarantine stay in `jetpack::Store` (they need the provider/network
//RS //! engine); `jetpack::Store` re-exports every item here so its own internal
//RS //! callers are unaffected. `jet-driver`'s module loader consumes `resolve`
//RS //! and `list` directly from this crate to resolve `use <pkg>` imports
//RS //! against packages already realized into the hangar, without depending on
//RS //! Jetpack's realization engine.
//RS 
